(The system compares a reference reading and a same-transcript take, estimates word) Tj T*
(boundaries, extracts local acoustic measurements, marks candidate deviations on the take) Tj T*
(timeline, and displays a reference-relative operational score. It targets pauses,) Tj T*
(recorded-level drops, locally faster words and locally slower words. Candidate events) Tj T*
(include start/end times, measured cause and an edit-strength-like severity. They are not) Tj T*
(human-rated rhetorical quality judgments.) Tj T*
