() Tj T*
(Three 0-10 operational dimensions cover pacing, pauses and local level. Merged events are) Tj T*
(scored by unique affected words with burden 1, 2 or 3 for minor, moderate or severe; this) Tj T*
(avoids multiplying a single displayed span by its number of word events. Pause score falls) Tj T*
(by 3 points per cumulative second of excess pause. The combined score is the mean of the) Tj T*
(three available dimensions. It is not a human preference score, speaking skill rating or) Tj T*
(MOS. Transcript or alignment failure withholds word-level measurements. Appropriate) Tj T*
(rhetorical pauses may be flagged.) Tj T*
