() Tj T*
(To improve the separate whole-clip task, logistic regression, RBF SVM, Random Forest,) Tj T*
(ExtraTrees and histogram gradient boosting were compared with five-fold grouped) Tj T*
(cross-validation over Reagan training passage families. Kennedy validation guarded against) Tj T*
(regression; it and the training families were then used to refit the selected ExtraTrees) Tj T*
(heads. The frozen model scored 104/104 \(100.0%, macro F1 1.000\) for digital edit type and) Tj T*
(101/104 \(97.1%, macro F1 0.977\) for programmed edit strength on the Obama test clips. This) Tj T*
(is the same fixed test set previously reported for the logistic baseline \(97.1% type) Tj T*
(accuracy; 73.1% strength accuracy\), so it is not a new independent benchmark. The candidate) Tj T*
(search did not use test outcomes. These are synthetic-operation recognition metrics, not) Tj T*
(speech-quality or natural-speech scores. The current model and protocol are documented in) Tj T*
(MODEL_CARD.md.) Tj T*
